msgstr "{actor} vás určil ako {role} pre správu PIN v NetBoxe."

#: roles.py:344
msgid "What it means:"
msgstr "Čo to znamená:"

#: roles.py:349 templates/netbox_user_pin/invitation.html:15
#: templates/netbox_user_pin/my_roles.html:18
msgid ""
"Together with the administrator you see and manage the PINs of all users and "
"departments."
msgstr ""
"Spolu s administrátorom vidíte a spravujete PINy všetkých používateľov a "
"oddelení."

#: roles.py:350 templates/netbox_user_pin/invitation.html:16
#: templates/netbox_user_pin/my_roles.html:19
msgid ""
"You confirm sensitive changes together with a second person (four eyes): "
"roles, settings, departments."
msgstr ""
"Citlivé zmeny potvrdzujete spolu s druhou osobou (štyri oči): roly, "
"nastavenia, oddelenia."

#: roles.py:352 templates/netbox_user_pin/invitation.html:17
msgid "You create departments and appoint their heads."
msgstr "Zakladáte oddelenia a určujete ich správcov."

#: roles.py:356
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"You manage the PINs of the people in the department {department}: allow / "
"deny, resets (the user always confirms them), suspend."
msgstr ""
"Spravujete PINy ľudí v oddelení {department}: povolenie / zákaz, resety "
"(používateľ ich vždy potvrdí), pozastavenie."

#: roles.py:358 templates/netbox_user_pin/invitation.html:20
msgid ""
"You invite the delegates of the department and can hand over your rights "
"temporarily."
msgstr "Pozývate delegátov oddelenia a svoje práva môžete dočasne odovzdať."

#: roles.py:359 templates/netbox_user_pin/invitation.html:21
msgid "You approve moves of people into and out of the department."
msgstr "Schvaľujete presuny ľudí do oddelenia a z neho."

#: roles.py:363
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Together with the head or another delegate you confirm changes in the "
"department {department} (four eyes)."
msgstr ""
"Spolu so správcom alebo iným delegátom potvrdzujete zmeny v oddelení "
"{department} (štyri oči)."

#: roles.py:365
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"You handle PIN and 2FA resets of the people in the department {department} "
"(the user always confirms them)."
msgstr ""
"Riešite resety PINu a 2FA ľudí v oddelení {department} (používateľ ich vždy "
"potvrdí)."

#: roles.py:367 templates/netbox_user_pin/invitation.html:25
msgid ""
"When the head is not available, two delegates together can hand the head's "
"rights over temporarily."
msgstr ""
"Keď správca nie je dostupný, dvaja delegáti spolu môžu jeho práva dočasne "
"odovzdať."

#: roles.py:371 templates/netbox_user_pin/invitation.html:27
msgid ""
"The PIN protects sensitive parts of NetBox and of other plugins that require "
"it (e.g. projects and documentation) – you share responsibility for this "
"protection."
msgstr ""
"PIN chráni citlivé časti NetBoxu aj ďalších pluginov, ktoré ho vyžadujú "
"(napr. projekty a dokumentácia) – za túto ochranu ste spoluzodpovedný."

#: roles.py:374
msgid "Your responsibility:"
msgstr "Vaša zodpovednosť:"

#: roles.py:375 templates/netbox_user_pin/invitation.html:31
msgid ""
"Never give your PIN, 2FA or backup codes to anybody; keep the phone with 2FA "
"with you."
msgstr ""
"PIN, 2FA ani záložné kódy nikomu nedávajte; telefón s 2FA majte pri sebe."

#: roles.py:376 templates/netbox_user_pin/invitation.html:32
msgid ""
"React to approval requests in time; confirm only what you understand and "
"what is justified."
msgstr ""
"Na žiadosti o schválenie reagujte včas; potvrďte iba to, čomu rozumiete a čo "
"je oprávnené."

#: roles.py:377 templates/netbox_user_pin/invitation.html:33
msgid "Every action you take is recorded in the audit log."
msgstr "Každá vaša akcia sa zapisuje do auditného záznamu."

#: roles.py:378 templates/netbox_user_pin/invitation.html:34
msgid ""
"You can resign under User PIN > My roles (it takes effect after a hand-over)."
msgstr "Funkcie sa môžete vzdať v User PIN > Moje roly (platí po odovzdaní)."

#: roles.py:382
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"This is a temporary hand-over: the rights end on {until} and then return to "
"{head}."
msgstr ""
"Ide o dočasné odovzdanie: práva končia {until} a potom sa vrátia "
"používateľovi {head}."

#: roles.py:384
#, python-brace-format
